ASSISTANT    - `--output-file "$PASSPHRASE_FILE"`
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT 4. **Decrypt the key** using:
ASSISTANT    ```bash
ASSISTANT    openssl enc -d -aes-128-cbc -pbkdf2 \
ASSISTANT      -iter 600000 \
ASSISTANT      -pass file:"$PASSPHRASE_FILE" \
ASSISTANT      -in "$ENCRYPTED_PEM_FILE" \
ASSISTANT      -out "$DECRYPTED_KEY_FILE"
ASSISTANT    ```
